WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:01.820
Here, try this.

00:00:02.308 --> 00:00:03.377
Lift your hand.

00:00:03.507 --> 00:00:04.936
Your shoulder goes first.

00:00:05.285 --> 00:00:07.044
Then let your wrist catch up.

00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:08.764
See that little delay?

00:00:08.813 --> 00:00:10.968
That's what makes the gesture feel alive.
